1
00:00:00,108 --> 00:00:03,238
Hey, look Amazing Spider-Man 193.

2
00:00:03,403 --> 00:00:04,733
(Sheldon:)Got it.

3
00:00:05,572 --> 00:00:07,862
(Howard:)Remember this one?
Spider-Man loses a big fight...

4
00:00:08,032 --> 00:00:10,372
(Howard:)...and then his girlfriend breaks up
with him.

5
00:00:13,538 --> 00:00:17,078
You want me to get it for you?
It will help take your mind off things.

6
00:00:17,584 --> 00:00:19,214
(Stuart:)Hey, guys. What's going on?

7
00:00:19,377 --> 00:00:21,967
Ah, we need to kill a couple hours
until the next showing.

8
00:00:22,130 --> 00:00:23,670
(Stuart:)Oh, well, no problem.

9
00:00:23,840 --> 00:00:26,010
(Stuart:)I was thinking of closing early,
and going home...

10
00:00:26,176 --> 00:00:31,306
...but let's face it, that's just a smaller
lonely room filled with comic books.

11
00:00:32,515 --> 00:00:34,185
(Leonard:)Thanks, Stuart.

12
00:00:35,226 --> 00:00:36,306
(Leonard:)Let me ask you.

13
00:00:36,478 --> 00:00:39,728
Do you think it's okay to have
an ex-boyfriend sleep on her couch?

14
00:00:39,898 --> 00:00:41,858
(Howard:)-She's obviously way out of line.
-Thank you.

15
00:00:42,025 --> 00:00:45,115
(Howard:)But if she dumps you,
she'll have a new boyfriend by tomorrow...

16
00:00:45,278 --> 00:00:48,618
(Howard:)...and you'll have a new girlfriend
when you figure out how to build one.

17
00:00:50,700 --> 00:00:53,790
(Howard:)So the only question is,
how long until you fold?

